### Create a new QRCode PIX

POST {{BASE_URL}}/{{API_VERSION}}/pixQrCode/create

Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ABACATEPAY_API_KEY}}

{
    "amount": 1000,
    "expiresIn": 1000,
    "description": "...",
    "customer": {
        "name": "Daniel Lima",
        "cellphone": "(11) 4002-8922",
        "email": "daniel_lima@abacatepay.com",
        "taxId": "123.456.789-01"
    },
    "metadata": {
        "externalId": "extr_pix_123"
    }
}

### Simulate a QRCode PIX payment

@QRCODE_PIX_ID = "YOUR_ID_HERE"

POST {{BASE_URL}}/{{API_VERSION}}/pixQrCode/simulate-payment?id={{QRCODE_PIX_ID}}

Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ABACATEPAY_API_KEY}}

{
    "metadata": {
        "externalId": "extr_pix_123"
    }
}

### Get QRCode PIX status by ID

GET {{BASE_URL}}/{{API_VERSION}}/pixQrCode/check?id={{QRCODE_PIX_ID}}

Authorization: Bearer {{ABACATEPAY_API_KEY}}
